planetary-cspice
=================

This package repackages the NASA/JPL NAIF CSPICE toolkit (version N0067) as a
shared library (libcspice.so) plus headers. No source code is added or
modified; the library is compiled directly from the upstream CSPICE C sources.

Upstream / source
------------------
NAIF (Navigation and Ancillary Information Facility), Jet Propulsion
Laboratory, California Institute of Technology.
  https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/toolkit.html
  https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/pub/naif/toolkit/C/

